    "25": {
      "note": "Cleanup preserves its check order and no-remains handling. Dry and real calls both return blocked/coded answers for live provider setup or terminal blockers. Incomplete integration returns integration-incomplete with worktree_record_landing guidance for a series and worktree_integrate guidance for a leaf; a recognized missing carryover returns carryover-required. Cleanup gains no force override from shared blocker wording. The archive-ready kept_line=None/no-rejudgment/no-invented-landedTips policy is now owned by _cleanup_terminal_branch and returned to cleanup_result; its earlier failure narrative is historical. Unrecognized exceptions remain named failures.",
